        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 31.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 1.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Torripo enkishui ino ti alo enyorrata oo mpesai aa nchoo kibaiki entoki niaata; amu etejo ninye, “Maapal maadamu nemaaing'uaa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 118.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku eikintieu aatejo, “Olaitoriani olaretoni lai, maureishoyu, kaa aaidim oltung'ani aitaasa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entadamu ilaiturukok linyi, lelo ooinosakita intae ele rorei le Enkai, entoduaai enkiting'oto e mpuaan enye, naa enturubare enkirukoto enye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore Yesu Kristo ninye ake olang'ole taata o ntarasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emincho eitapong'ori intae too nkiteng'enat naapaashaa; amu keishiaakino naa empiris naitagol oltau, neme indaiki, neitu eret lelo ooitudupita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eikiaata iyiook olperere lo lasar lemeng'arie iyiook lelo ooisiaaisho teilo ng'obor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 16.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ore nkiri e nena kishu naayau olapolosani ine wueji sinyati aitaa olasar loo ng'ok naa ti auluo enkang oo lng'oborri epejori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore sii ninye Yesu naa ti auluo kishomi einosieki osina pee etum aitisinya iltung'ana lenyena to sarge lenye makewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina emainyeito aapuo auluo enkang oo lng'oborri, nikinapaki nena morot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu mikiaata iyiook enkanasa nikibikie te ne, kake ae anasa king'oru nalotu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti atua ninye naa maitaiki Enkai anaa ake olasar le nkisisa, aa inchere, ilng'anayio loo nkutukie naalimu enkarna enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emintololoiki easata oo supati, o eng'arata oo ntokitin niaatata, amu ore ilasarri laaijo lelo naa keitiship Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entoning ilarikok linyi niyanyititi, amu iltauja linyi eirrita, anaa iltung'ana ooyookini aikilikuan, enchoo naa eiko ninche neijia te ng'ida, neme to sina, amu meeta ina dupoto te intae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entoomonoki iyiook, amu king'idare ena nchere mikiaata ileeni ti atua iltauja lang, eikiyieu nikiaasisho to rrekie sidai too mbaa pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukunyaki intae naleng enkuna neijia pee aasiokini aarrinyoki intae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkomono nabayie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata Enkai e seriani nanyaaka ashuku Olaitoriani Yesu aitung'uaa ilootuata, ilo shekut kitok loo nkerra, te ilo sarge lo sotua loo ntarasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meishopoki intae pooki toki sidai pee itumutumu aataas ina nayieu ninye, neas ina naitiship ninye ti atua intae; ti atua Yesu Kristo, olaa enenye enkitoo ntarasi o ntarasi. Esai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Irorei oobayie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
